        <h2 style="text-align:center; text-transform:unset;">OFFICIAL PROMOTION RULES</h2>
        <h3 style="text-align:center; text-transform:unset;">Steak-umm Sliced Steak<br/>
Cheesesteak Day Recipe Giveaway<br/>
March 8th through March 24th</h3>
        <p>NO PURCHASE OF ANY KIND IS NECESSARY TO ENTER OR WIN. MAKING A PURCHASE WILL NOT INCREASE YOUR CHANCES OF WINNING. VOID WHERE PROHIBITED BY LAW.</p>
        <p>
        On March 26, 2021, one (1) first prize winner, one (1) second prize winner, and one (1) third prize winner will be chosen based on the total vote count. Winners will receive the following from STEAK-UMM®:
        </p>
        <p>
            <b>One (1) first prize winner will receive:</b><br/>
            • A one-year supply of STEAK-UMM® sliced steak via fifty-two (52) coupons ($260)<br/>
            • Steak-umm brand t-shirt<br/>
            • Steak-umm brand mask<br/>
            <b>One (1) second prize winner will receive:</b><br/>
            • A six-month supply of STEAK-UMM® via twenty-six (26) coupons ($130)<br/>
            • Steak-umm brand t-shirt<br/>
            • Steak-umm brand mask<br/>
            <b>One (1) third prize winner will receive:</b><br/>
            • A three-month supply of STEAK-UMM® via thirteen (13) coupons ($65)<br/>
            • Steak-umm brand t-shirt<br/>
            • Steak-umm brand mask<br/>
        </p>
            <p>1. Contest is open to legal United States residents, residing in the United States, eighteen years of age or older. Employees of STEAK-UMM® brand and members of their immediate families, Steak-umm brand parent, subsidiaries, affiliates and their advertising, promotion and production agencies are not eligible to enter. Entry into this contest constitutes acceptance of these Official Rules.</p>

    <p>2. How to enter: Participants must complete a submission at <a href="https://steakumm.allebach.com">steakumm.allebach.com</a> between March 8, 2021 and March 24, 2021. Participants may enter by completing the form online and submitting a photo of the recipe. Once the recipe and content are approved, an administrator will review the content to ensure it meets brand standards. Participants may enter multiple recipes, but only one recipe entry per day and may not submit the same recipe multiple times. All entries will be deemed made by the authorized account holder of the email address submitted at time of entry. Limit one winner per household or address. </p>

    <p>3. All winners will receive an email message from STEAK-UMM® partner, Allebach Communications, requesting additional information. If a potential winner fails to respond within 10 days, or fails to provide Steak-umm® with the requested information within 10 days, or it is determined that the winner is not eligible to win, the prize will be forfeited and that prize will not be awarded.</p>

    <p>4. This contest is governed exclusively by the laws of the United States.  </p>

    <p>5. STEAK-UMM® is not responsible for entries that may be lost, late, delayed or misdirected, damaged, illegible, or incorrect. Entries will not be acknowledged or returned. Electronic entries that are incomplete, incorrect, illegible and/or deemed not eligible by STEAK-UMM® will be automatically disqualified. STEAK-UMM® is not responsible for incorrect data, electronic, network, computer or other technical malfunctions that may occur upon collection, processing and transmission of data, nor for any type of graphical or other error in the administration of the promotion. </p>

    <p>6. In case of dispute as to the identity of any online entrant, the entry will be declared made by the registered name and address on such entry. Each potential winner will be requested to provide STEAK-UMM® with proof that such person is the winner.  Any other attempted form of entry is prohibited; no automatic, programmed, robotic or similar means of entry are permitted. CAUTION: ANY ATTEMPT BY AN ENTRANT TO DELIBERATELY DAMAGE ANY WEBSITE OR UNDERMINE THE LEGITIMATE OPERATION OF THE PROMOTION MAY BE A VIOLATION OF CRIMINAL AND CIVIL LAWS AND SHOULD SUCH AN ATTEMPT BE MADE, STEAK-UMM® RESERVES THE RIGHT TO SEEK DAMAGES FROM ANY SUCH PERSON TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW.  </p>

    <p>7. A total of three (3) Prize Winners will win from those meeting the criteria established under the contest rules between the dates of March 8, 2021 through March 24, 2021. The decisions of STEAK-UMM® with respect to the winners in regard to all matters relating to this promotion, shall be final.  </p>

    <p>8. Winners will be selected at random. Odds of winning depend on the number of eligible entries received for the promotion.</p>

   <p> 9. By entering the contest, entrants fully and unconditionally agree to be bound by these rules and the decisions of the judges appointed by STEAK-UMM®, which will be final and binding in all matters relating to the contest. Winners will be contacted via the provided email address.</p>

    <p>10. There will be no prize substitutions in lieu of prizes other than that described in the contest rules. Winners will be solely responsible for any and all applicable federal, state, and local taxes and gratuities. </p>

    <p>11. STEAK-UMM® is not responsible for winner limitations that prevent acceptance or use of any prize. </p>

    <p>12. STEAK-UMM® may rescind, cancel or revoke this contest without liability at STEAK-UMM® sole discretion. </p>

    <p>13. All entries become the property of STEAK-UMM®. Winners agree that STEAK-UMM®, its affiliates, subsidiaries, advertising and promotion agencies and employees the (“Released Parties”) shall have no liability in connection with acceptance or use of the prizes offered.  By accepting these prizes, winners agree to hold harmless the Released Parties for any injuries, damages or losses that may be sustained in connection with the ownership, use or misuse of any prize. Acceptance of any prize shall constitute and signify the winner’s agreement and consent that STEAK-UMM® may in perpetuity use the winner’s name, likeness, and/or prize information for promotional purposes without further payment or consideration. </p>

    <p>14. For a list of winners, send a self-addressed, stamped envelope to: STEAK-UMM® Cheesesteak Day Recipe Contest - Winners’ List”, c/o Allebach Communications, Marketing Department, 117 N. Main St., Souderton, PA, 18964. Requests must be received by March 31, 2021. </p>

    <p>15. By entering this contest, I hereby certify to STEAK-UMM® that I am eligible to participate in the above - mentioned contest. In consideration for value received, receipt being hereby acknowledged, and intending to be legally bound, I give STEAK-UMM® or its advertising/media agents, right and permission to use my name in advertising and other promotional matters, as STEAK-UMM® so desires, with no further compensation to me, cash or otherwise, I certify that neither I, nor any immediate member of my family or household is an employee of STEAK-UMM®, subsidiaries, affiliates or their advertising, promotion or production agencies. I certify that I am 18 years of age or older, have read and followed the rules of the contest, and know of no reason why I should not be designated as a winner and receive the prize involved. As stated in the contest rules, I understand that all federal, state, and local taxes on the value of the prize, which I accept, is solely my responsibility as the prize winner. I also understand that STEAK-UMM® will issue an IRS Form 1099 (for all prizes exceeding $600.00) indicating the fair market value of the prize to me and to the federal government for tax reporting purposes. I, for myself and my successors and assigns, do hereby release STEAK-UMM®, its affiliated companies, employees, officers, directors, shareholders, agents, and their advertising/media agencies or affiliates, from any and all actions, causes of action, suits, damages, judgments, claims or demands whatsoever, in law or in equity, including but not limited to, claims of personal injury or wrongful death which I, successors and assigns now has or hereafter can, shall or may have for, upon or by reason of any matter, cause or thing whatsoever to the extent permitted by law. There will be no prize substitutions or transfers. No purchase necessary to win. In case of a dispute, the decision of the judges is final. If any statement made by me in this affidavit is false, I agree